msgstr "Breng ACF PRO-repeaters, flexibele inhoud, galerijen, optiepagina's, blokken en veldgroepen naar Minn. Download de plug-in .zip van ACF."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:6664
msgid "Manage Elementor form submissions in Minn while keeping Elementor-owned page content protected. Download the plugin .zip from Elementor."
